("terse","LATIN ORIGIN",[("tergere","to wipe, rub off","擦拭","a cloth wiping a board"),("tersus","wiped clean, neat","擦乾淨的","a shiny clean board")],("all extra words wiped off → short and blunt","簡潔的；簡短生硬的"),"a girl erases a long rambling sentence on the whiteboard until only 'No.' remains; her friend blinks in surprise.","Wipe away each extra word,","A terse reply is all you heard."),
