("austere","GREEK ORIGIN",[("austeros","harsh, dry, bitter","乾澀的、嚴厲的","a dry sour lemon"),("-","plain and strict","樸素而嚴格","a plain bare room")],("harsh and dry → strict, very plain","樸素的；嚴峻的"),"a stern old headmaster sits in a bare room with one wooden chair, one candle, and no decorations, frowning seriously.","Plain and strict, no fun at all,","Austere rooms with bare gray walls."),
